---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/blog-placeholder-about.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Vernika Chauhan"
	description="The creator behind Ember & Ghee"
	pubDate={new Date('Oct 04 2026')}
>
	<div class="prose max-w-none">
		<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-4">Welcome to Ember & Ghee!</h2>
		
		<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
			Hi, I'm Vernika Chauhan! I am a passionate food creator sharing easy, vibrant, and comforting home-style Indian recipes. Whether you are looking for quick breakfast ideas, delicious South Indian classics, or rich desserts, my goal is to make cooking accessible and fun for everyone.
		</p>

		<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
			Through my channels on YouTube, Instagram, and Facebook, I share step-by-step videos that bring these recipes to life. This website is a dedicated space where you can find all the ingredients, written instructions, and direct links to the recipe videos.
		</p>

		<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Let's Collaborate</h3>
		<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
			I love partnering with brands and creators who share my passion for food and lifestyle. If you're interested in sponsorships, recipe development, or just want to say hi, I'd love to hear from you!
		</p>
		
		<div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center mt-8 border border-orange-100">
			<span class="block text-gray-600 font-semibold mb-2">For Business Inquiries & Collabs:</span>
			<a href="mailto:contact@emberandghee.com" class="text-2xl font-bold text-orange-600 hover:text-orange-700 transition underline">contact@emberandghee.com</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
